]

### 7 cli query due.x.md map(sort_by(tasks, fn(r) => r.due), fn(r) => r.title) --json
$ xmd query due.x.md map(sort_by(tasks, fn(r) => r.due), fn(r) => r.title) --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T12:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
